1109:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****         reception services:
1110:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UARTEx_RxEventCallback()
